udvm-s: x / y and x % y, for x from 0 to 999 and y from 1 to 999.
Cells 82-98. To call it, put y in cell 96, load x into the accumulator and JMP 82.
It returns the quotient x / y in the accumulator and the remainder x % y in cell 95.
It overwrites its own cells and cell 99; y in cell 96 is kept.
Size 17 cells. It runs at most 8,002 instructions, 36.3 on average, counted from cell 82 to the return jump in cell 98.
Exact over the domain.

cell  contents   notes
 82     695      STO 95   cells 82-84: the call: store x, and copy the return jump from cell 99 into cell 98
 83     199      CLA 99
 84     698      STO 98
 85     404      SFT 04   cells 85-93: q = 0 by SFT 04; then take y from x while that leaves 0 or more, counting in q
 86     694      STO 94
 87     195      CLA 95
 88     796      SUB 96
 89     397      TAC 97
 90     695      STO 95
 91     194      CLA 94
 92     200      ADD 00
 93     886      JMP 86
 94     000      data: the quotient q
 95     000      data: x, and then the remainder
 96     000      data: y, which is kept
 97     194      CLA 94   cell 97: the quotient into the accumulator
 98     000               set on every call: the jump back to the caller
